# QR Menu Maker — example environment
# Copy to .dev.vars for local development (NEVER commit .dev.vars).
# Production secrets: set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
# No real secrets in this repo — placeholders only.

# Required. One-time token protecting the first-admin setup page (/admin-setup).
# Generate with: openssl rand -hex 32
SETUP_TOKEN=REPLACE_WITH_A_RANDOM_32_BYTE_HEX_TOKEN

# Optional. Cloudflare Turnstile secret key (server-side verification).
# The public site key goes in wrangler.toml [vars] TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY.
# Leave both empty to run without Turnstile.
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
